  "unresolved": [
    "The Chinese official page identifies the II as full-frame at macro distances but explicitly warns of mechanically obscured edges at distant focus and recommends crop mode. The existing APS-C coverage is retained because the unconditional coverage field cannot express this focus-dependent limit; a blanket full-frame claim would omit the manufacturer warning.",
    "The Chinese diagram gives approximately 72 × 118 mm and 660 g without a Nikon Z measurement condition, whereas the existing record gives 68 × 118 mm. The prior dimensions and mass are retained, with the published approximation added to mass, pending Nikon Z-specific measurements and cap/length datum clarification.",
